tests-in-morocco-turn-deadly-3-killed-so-far/articleshow/124276515.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-10-02T21:48:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-124276573,imgsize-1034352.cms"/></item><item><title>Federal government layoffs likely to be in thousands, White House confirms amid shutdown; shifts blame to Democrats</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/124276392.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/federal-government-layoffs-likely-to-be-in-thousands-white-house-confirms-amid-shutdown-shifts-blame-to-democrats/articleshow/124276392.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/federal-government-layoffs-likely-to-be-in-thousands-white-house-confirms-amid-shutdown-shifts-blame-to-democrats/articleshow/124276392.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-10-02T21:26:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-124276393,imgsize-39996.cms"/></item><item><title>D4vd update: Why does no one know how Celeste Rivas died? Expert says her 71-pound body weight suggests massive decomposition</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/124276247.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/d4vd-update-why-does-no-one-know-how-celeste-rivas-died-expert-says-her-71-pound-body-weight-suggests-massive-decomposition/articleshow/124276247.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/d4vd-update-why-does-no-one-know-how-celeste-rivas-died-expert-says-her-71-pound-body-weight-suggests-massive-decomposition/articleshow/124276247.cms</guid><pu